\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God is with us, God is with us,
\par So our brave forefathers sang,
\par Far across the field of battle
\par Loud their holy war-cry rang;
\par Never once they ceased to sing:
\par \i 
\par \cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par God is with us, God is with us,
\par Christ our Lord Shall reign as King!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Great the heritage they left us,
\par Great the conquest to be won,
\par Armed hosts to meet and scatter,
\par Larger duties to be done.
\par Raise the song they nobly taught us,
\par Round the wide world let it ring:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par God is with us, God is with us,
\par Christ our Lord Shall reign as King!
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Speed the Cross through all the nations,
\par Speed the victories of love,
\par Preach the gospel of redemption
\par Whosoever men may move;
\par Make the future in the present,
\par Strong of heart, toil on and sing:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par God is with us, God is with us,
\par Christ our Lord Shall reign as King!
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Soon the struggle will be over,
\par Soon the flags of strife be furled;
\par Downward from his place, defeated,
\par Shall the enemy be hurle;
\par Onward, the, with ranks unbroken,
\par Sure of triumph, shout  and sing;
\par \i 
\par \cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par God is with us, God is with us,
\par Christ our Lord Shall reign as King!
\par 
\par \i0\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

